    8. Invalid location test
    9. Celsius/Fahrenheit switch works
    10. Hourly and daily forecast inspection
    11. Browser console inspected for errors
  - Responsive design verified at: 320px, 375px, 390px, 430px, 768px, 1024px, 1280px, 1440px
- [ ] Independent engineering review
